{"game": "gunfire-reborn", "language": "english", "appid": 1217060, "month": "2021-03", "window": 2, "start_date": 1615161600, "end_date": 1615852799, "month_true_total": 522, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-27 01:48:16 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "88506350", "author": {"steamid": "76561198113962160", "personaname": "phil.", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/whoisphil/", "num_games_owned": 453, "num_reviews": 97, "playtime_forever": 790, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 48, "last_played": 1715488648, "avatar": "f3de7e970fb9f6878ea0fbc2d984f0afbbf53af7"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game feels like a cheaper version of Borderlands; loot mechanics, speed, abilities, skill tree and boss intros. \n\nFor only $12, it doesn't feel like a early access game.", "timestamp_created": 1615849356, "timestamp_updated": 1615849356, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.50466841459274292", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "88498939", "author": {"steamid": "76561197971419206", "personaname": "StuNorth", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197971419206/", "num_games_owned": 238, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 1118, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 415, "last_played": 1691699216, "avatar": "7febc58858cda54dd930dd10469caff7b5483c20"}, "language": "english", "review": "Absolutely great for jumpin into with friends just talking and having gameplay as secondary.", "timestamp_created": 1615838300, "timestamp_updated": 1615838300, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "88498533", "author": {"steamid": "76561198156400852", "personaname": "pvmcgooey", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/pvviking/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 355, "playtime_forever": 379, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 223, "last_played": 1637856660, "avatar": "3f3e335820859204f3bcba50182436113752db7d"}, "language": "english", "review": "im not super big into rogue likes but im a fan of this one. 7/10", "timestamp_created": 1615837738, "timestamp_updated": 1615837738, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "88498330", "author": {"steamid": "76561198170609466", "personaname": "ɯᴏT", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198170609466/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 1901, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1355, "last_played": 1639000416, "avatar": "1623f7751b05a696bbda5b45c3c5e4b2d3fd1845"}, "language": "english", "review": "very fun", "timestamp_created": 1615837471, "timestamp_updated": 1615837471, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 10, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "88495098", "author": {"steamid": "76561197964109211", "personaname": "Andrige", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Andrige/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 45761, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 345, "playtime_at_review": 4716, "deck_playtime_at_review": 397, "last_played": 1790196589, "avatar": "3faeaf01829c4a09270a1bbceaf9267cabdda47a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Gunfire is my top choice for a roguelite. \n\nThe game keeps pushing for player choice, adding modifiers which add something good; but at a cost. \n\nThe support for this title has been excellent and fair, adding PLENTY of new ways to play. It's the sort of game where I can run the same character, but differently, hoping for some build defining weapon effect or Scroll to drop. Before the run even starts, I have a fantasy of what build I want, and then I have a blast trying to make it work, even after so many hours. And once I feel like I've done my set of fun builds, I can just rotate back to some old one and try it out again because there's been so many new updates to the game since last I tried it.\n\nMy only gripe is that the DLC characters are comparatively narrow in what they do. They are often overtuned to the point where I never play as them, and their niché can sometimes even entirely avoid the need for a good weapon. Out of the four DLC characters I only consistently run Xing Zhe (monkey) since it's the one that feels most balanced while offering enough interesting choices. You'll probably enjoy them, but personally I wish they'd break from this pattern in the future.\n\nTL;DR: 11/10, best.", "timestamp_created": 1615833262, "timestamp_updated": 1692979330, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}]}